1
00:01:30,340 --> 00:01:33,578
=Against The Current=

2
00:01:33,579 --> 00:01:35,000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

3
00:01:35,180 --> 00:01:36,920
=Episode 35=
(This drama does not correspond)

4
00:01:36,930 --> 00:01:38,200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

5
00:01:38,210 --> 00:01:41,160
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

6
00:01:48,480 --> 00:01:49,230
Fall back!

7
00:01:50,200 --> 00:01:51,680
That scoundrel Lin Jinqi

8
00:01:51,680 --> 00:01:53,070
is going to blow up the armory!

9
00:01:53,070 --> 00:01:53,870
Everyone, fall back!

10
00:01:57,000 --> 00:01:57,870
Kill him!

11
00:01:58,070 --> 00:01:59,000
- Yes!
- Yes!

12
00:04:20,580 --> 00:04:22,420
♪I no longer blame the moon♪

13
00:04:22,420 --> 00:04:26,860
♪For withholding its light♪

14
00:04:28,190 --> 00:04:29,680
Prince Han!

15
00:04:31,140 --> 00:04:34,580
♪Still live and thrive♪

16
00:04:37,070 --> 00:04:39,630
Lin Jinqi has ruined my plans.

17
00:04:39,870 --> 00:04:43,510
Only his death will satisfy my hatred!

18
00:04:44,560 --> 00:04:45,360
Wei Bao!

19
00:04:46,600 --> 00:04:47,190
Yes.

20
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:52,560
Bring me Lin Jinqi's head.

21
00:04:53,310 --> 00:04:55,510
I shall make you a marquis!

22
00:04:56,510 --> 00:04:58,750
I swear I won't return

23
00:04:58,856 --> 00:05:00,170
until I've taken Lin Jinqi's head.

24
00:05:01,360 --> 00:05:02,430
Go!

25
00:05:14,720 --> 00:05:18,040
Lin Jinqi may have destroyed the armory,

26
00:05:19,120 --> 00:05:23,270
but I have the Changling Guards
and Shenji Battalion outside,

27
00:05:24,160 --> 00:05:25,830
and the Tiance Guards inside.

28
00:05:26,270 --> 00:05:29,270
With attacks from both sides, the
Imperial Guards won't stand a chance.

29
00:05:29,430 --> 00:05:30,720
- Yes!
- Yes!

30
00:05:33,800 --> 00:05:36,190
Follow me into the capital!

31
00:05:38,310 --> 00:05:40,070
You'll be made marquises and ministers!

32
00:05:47,560 --> 00:05:48,360
Young Madam.

33
00:05:48,720 --> 00:05:50,630
It's dangerous here. We can't stay long.

34
00:05:50,750 --> 00:05:51,950
We must hurry.

35
00:05:53,040 --> 00:05:53,950
The Shenji Battalion

36
00:05:55,160 --> 00:05:56,870
has joined Prince Han's rebellion.

37
00:05:58,424 --> 00:05:59,920
Why do you say that, Young Madam?

38
00:06:01,310 --> 00:06:02,870
If the Shenji Battalion hadn't rebelled,

39
00:06:03,560 --> 00:06:05,630
Young Master wouldn't
have destroyed the armory.

40
00:06:06,344 --> 00:06:08,730
Prince Han must have taken control
of the Shenji Battalion.

41
00:06:09,040 --> 00:06:10,390
Young Master had no other choice

42
00:06:10,440 --> 00:06:12,376
but to destroy
the weapons at their source

43
00:06:12,408 --> 00:06:14,680
to keep Prince Han
from using firearms to attack the city.

44
00:06:16,680 --> 00:06:17,830
This billowing smoke

45
00:06:18,270 --> 00:06:19,680
also serves as a warning signal.

46
00:06:20,240 --> 00:06:22,430
If anyone sees it, they'll report it.

47
00:06:24,088 --> 00:06:25,750
The Imperial Guards defending the city

48
00:06:26,056 --> 00:06:27,920
will close the city gates
as soon as possible.

49
00:06:30,104 --> 00:06:31,190
Then Deputy Commander Lin...

50
00:06:31,390 --> 00:06:32,390
Is he... Is he safe?

51
00:06:35,830 --> 00:06:36,680
I don't know.

52
00:06:38,160 --> 00:06:40,870
But even if he's alive,

53
00:06:41,544 --> 00:06:42,950
his life is hanging by a thread.

54
00:06:43,336 --> 00:06:44,870
There's no telling if he'll survive.

55
00:06:46,510 --> 00:06:47,800
Deputy Commander Lin

56
00:06:48,510 --> 00:06:49,830
only has Nanke with him.

57
00:07:05,920 --> 00:07:06,950
Young Master always says

58
00:07:07,688 --> 00:07:10,190
a husband and wife are one
and share both fortune and hardship.

59
00:07:11,360 --> 00:07:12,390
Now that he's in danger,

60
00:07:13,390 --> 00:07:14,720
I can't stand by and do nothing.

61
00:07:16,070 --> 00:07:17,190
Go save Young Master.

62
00:07:20,750 --> 00:07:21,510
No.

63
00:07:21,672 --> 00:07:23,120
Deputy Commander Lin gave us orders

64
00:07:23,510 --> 00:07:25,720
to escort you back to the retreat.

65
00:07:26,240 --> 00:07:28,190
Young Madam,
please get in the carriage.

66
00:07:32,600 --> 00:07:34,040
Having a group of soldiers follow me

67
00:07:34,270 --> 00:07:35,680
will only draw attention.

68
00:07:36,270 --> 00:07:37,000
Besides,

69
00:07:37,310 --> 00:07:38,800
you're soldiers of the imperial court.

70
00:07:39,800 --> 00:07:41,360
Your duty is to protect the people,

71
00:07:42,040 --> 00:07:43,430
not me alone.

72
00:07:44,600 --> 00:07:45,950
If you can save Young Master,

73
00:07:46,310 --> 00:07:48,310
you may also be able to help
the Imperial Guards

74
00:07:48,800 --> 00:07:50,310
and keep the people safe.

75
00:07:53,928 --> 00:07:55,730
Your selflessness
is admirable, Young Madam.

76
00:07:56,190 --> 00:07:57,830
Forgive me for breaking my word.

77
00:07:58,310 --> 00:07:59,830
I cannot keep my promise

78
00:08:00,190 --> 00:08:02,390
to escort you back to the retreat.

79
00:08:16,510 --> 00:08:17,430
Men!

80
00:08:17,680 --> 00:08:19,870
Let's go meet Prince Han's forces.

81
00:08:19,920 --> 00:08:20,950
- Yes!
- Yes!

82
00:08:22,070 --> 00:08:22,630
Hyah!

83
00:08:23,160 --> 00:08:23,510
Hyah!

84
00:08:32,240 --> 00:08:33,000
Young Madam.

85
00:08:33,910 --> 00:08:34,840
Let's go back...

86
00:08:36,150 --> 00:08:37,270
Back to the retreat.

87
00:08:56,670 --> 00:08:57,360
Young Master.

88
00:09:06,856 --> 00:09:08,390
(Command Token)
Take this command token

89
00:09:08,696 --> 00:09:10,520
(of the Shence Garrison Commander)
and go to the Five Armies Camp.

90
00:09:10,840 --> 00:09:12,630
Ask Duke Ying to send troops.

91
00:09:13,840 --> 00:09:15,390
Only by holding Prince Han back

92
00:09:16,200 --> 00:09:18,240
can the Imperial Guards
focus on attacking

93
00:09:18,600 --> 00:09:20,670
the Tiance Guards
who infiltrated the city

94
00:09:21,120 --> 00:09:22,670
and lift the siege on the Imperial City.

95
00:09:23,750 --> 00:09:26,840
Duke Ying strictly follows
the rules and refuses to bend.

96
00:09:27,000 --> 00:09:29,990
Without His Majesty's handwritten edict
or orders from the Ministry of War,

97
00:09:30,024 --> 00:09:32,080
my word alone won't
convince him to deploy troops.

98
00:09:32,080 --> 00:09:33,360
Back then, the late Emperor

99
00:09:34,150 --> 00:09:36,750
thought Prince Han was much like himself

100
00:09:37,720 --> 00:09:40,790
and wanted to depose the Crown Prince
and make Prince Han his heir.

101
00:09:41,000 --> 00:09:43,120
It was Duke Ying
who dissuaded the late Emperor.

102
00:09:43,870 --> 00:09:45,360
Though the matter was confidential,

103
00:09:45,910 --> 00:09:47,910
others still knew about it.

104
00:09:48,320 --> 00:09:49,840
If Prince Han takes the throne

105
00:09:50,360 --> 00:09:51,670
and learns of this,

106
00:09:52,440 --> 00:09:54,080
what will become of Duke Ying?

107
00:09:54,750 --> 00:09:57,000
And what will become of the hundred

108
00:09:57,510 --> 00:09:58,910
or so members of his household?

109
00:10:04,000 --> 00:10:05,670
Ask Duke Ying for me

110
00:10:06,750 --> 00:10:08,320
if he still remembers

111
00:10:09,080 --> 00:10:12,630
what happened
to Grand Secretary Shen back then.

112
00:10:17,510 --> 00:10:18,440
I remember.

113
00:10:19,840 --> 00:10:20,750
I remember.

114
00:10:25,720 --> 00:10:26,670
Go.

115
00:10:28,270 --> 00:10:29,120
But Young Master...

116
00:10:29,840 --> 00:10:30,790
Go.

117
00:10:32,630 --> 00:10:34,320
That's an order.

118
00:10:40,080 --> 00:10:41,270
With me,

119
00:10:41,630 --> 00:10:43,200
you won't be able to move fast.

120
00:10:47,080 --> 00:10:48,320
Ride.

121
00:10:49,440 --> 00:10:50,270
Go!

122
00:10:51,870 --> 00:10:53,000
Hurry!

123
00:11:02,080 --> 00:11:03,030
Take care, Young Master!

124
00:11:23,300 --> 00:11:27,100
♪With my own hands and heart♪

125
00:11:27,100 --> 00:11:30,140
♪I write my name♪

126
00:11:30,820 --> 00:11:34,500
♪Through countless lines of ink♪

127
00:11:34,860 --> 00:11:37,820
♪Step by step toward the light♪

128
00:11:37,820 --> 00:11:41,980
♪With what I know and what I do♪

129
00:11:41,980 --> 00:11:45,340
♪I'll rewrite my fate♪

130
00:11:45,380 --> 00:11:47,420
♪The long night is almost over♪

131
00:11:47,420 --> 00:11:55,420
♪I won't dwell on the past anymore♪

132
00:12:12,270 --> 00:12:14,240
Lin Jinqi can't have gone far.

133
00:12:14,632 --> 00:12:15,790
Search everywhere carefully.

134
00:12:16,480 --> 00:12:18,320
With his head, I'll be made a marquis.

135
00:12:19,270 --> 00:12:20,910
You'll all be rewarded, too.

136
00:12:21,150 --> 00:12:22,200
- Yes!
- Yes!

137
00:12:29,360 --> 00:12:30,200
Captain Wei.

138
00:12:43,790 --> 00:12:45,630
Lin Jinqi stopped here.

139
00:12:46,152 --> 00:12:48,030
The heavy snow
hasn't covered his tracks yet.

140
00:12:50,200 --> 00:12:51,630
He can't have left long ago.

141
00:12:52,440 --> 00:12:53,360
Go after him at once!

142
00:12:53,360 --> 00:12:54,024
- Yes!
- Yes!

143
00:13:57,544 --> 00:13:58,808
Prince Han has twisted the truth

144
00:13:58,824 --> 00:14:00,630
and accused
the Imperial Guards of rebellion.

145
00:14:00,640 --> 00:14:02,380
Under the pretext
of suppressing the rebellion,

146
00:14:02,390 --> 00:14:03,430
he led the Changling Guards

147
00:14:03,440 --> 00:14:04,830
and the Shenji Battalion
to attack Xizhi Gate

148
00:14:04,840 --> 00:14:06,090
in an attempt to enter the city.

149
00:14:06,104 --> 00:14:07,630
Fortunately, the Imperial Guards
defending the city

150
00:14:07,630 --> 00:14:09,660
saw the billowing warning smoke
from the Shenji Battalion's direction

151
00:14:09,670 --> 00:14:11,192
and locked the city gates in advance.

152
00:14:11,200 --> 00:14:12,296
(Yang Pu, Deputy Commander)
They have kept Prince Han's

153
00:14:12,300 --> 00:14:13,368
(of the Imperial Guard, Lower Third-Rank)
army outside the city.

154
00:14:13,480 --> 00:14:15,110
The two sides are now engaged in battle.

155
00:14:15,120 --> 00:14:16,030
For the time being,

156
00:14:16,072 --> 00:14:18,190
they can't spare
any forces to aid the Imperial City.

157
00:14:19,048 --> 00:14:20,480
(Second Prince)
Then what do we do?

158
00:14:20,648 --> 00:14:22,072
(Eldest Imperial Son)
That scoundrel Tian Fang

159
00:14:22,088 --> 00:14:23,496
has already led the Tiance Guards

160
00:14:23,550 --> 00:14:24,790
to Wu Gate?

161
00:14:25,910 --> 00:14:27,390
After receiving Fengtai's warning,

162
00:14:27,630 --> 00:14:30,240
I issued an edict mobilizing
the City Patrol Offices

163
00:14:30,440 --> 00:14:32,030
to help defend the Imperial City.

164
00:14:32,320 --> 00:14:33,840
Where are the City Patrol Offices now?

165
00:14:34,776 --> 00:14:36,140
Some men in the City Patrol Offices

166
00:14:36,150 --> 00:14:37,840
were also deceived by Prince Han.

167
00:14:38,790 --> 00:14:39,550
Right now,

168
00:14:39,960 --> 00:14:41,370
the two sides are fighting fiercely.

169
00:14:54,240 --> 00:14:55,030
Your Majesty.

170
00:14:55,550 --> 00:14:57,080
The rebels are advancing in force.

171
00:14:57,480 --> 00:14:58,510
In my opinion,

172
00:14:58,790 --> 00:15:00,870
Your Majesty should leave the palace

173
00:15:00,960 --> 00:15:03,000
and take refuge
outside the city for now.

174
00:15:05,630 --> 00:15:06,320
Yes.

175
00:15:06,440 --> 00:15:09,550
Father, we should take refuge for now.

176
00:15:10,150 --> 00:15:11,440
Grand Secretary Zhao is right.

177
00:15:11,440 --> 00:15:12,200
Father.

178
00:15:12,248 --> 00:15:14,248
We should follow
Grand Secretary Zhao's advice.

179
00:15:17,120 --> 00:15:18,910
If Your Majesty leaves the palace,

180
00:15:19,360 --> 00:15:21,270
first, the rebels
will find the palace empty

181
00:15:21,360 --> 00:15:22,510
and their morale will plummet.

182
00:15:22,960 --> 00:15:23,480
Second,

183
00:15:23,750 --> 00:15:27,390
the Imperial Guard can fight
the rebels without restraint.

184
00:15:27,600 --> 00:15:29,630
As their strength wanes and ours grows,

185
00:15:29,960 --> 00:15:33,270
we will surely wipe out
the rebels in one stroke.

186
00:15:33,944 --> 00:15:35,240
Grand Secretary Zhao is right.

187
00:15:35,672 --> 00:15:36,720
There's no time to lose.

188
00:15:36,790 --> 00:15:38,550
Father, leave the palace at once.

189
00:15:44,600 --> 00:15:47,150
Your Majesty, please leave the palace.

190
00:15:47,720 --> 00:15:51,030
- Your Majesty, please leave the palace.
- Your Majesty, please leave the palace.

191
00:15:59,672 --> 00:16:01,080
Grand Secretary Zhao, may I ask,

192
00:16:01,960 --> 00:16:04,520
if His Majesty is to leave
the palace, an edict must be drafted.

193
00:16:04,910 --> 00:16:05,750
How

194
00:16:06,870 --> 00:16:07,960
should this edict be worded?

195
00:16:08,910 --> 00:16:11,880
You're merely an official of the
Hanlin Academy. Just follow your orders.

196
00:16:12,240 --> 00:16:14,840
You have no place speaking in this hall!

197
00:16:15,320 --> 00:16:18,480
I am the Hanlin Academy official
on duty in the palace today.

198
00:16:18,790 --> 00:16:21,080
As I am to draft this edict,

199
00:16:21,840 --> 00:16:23,270
I must know every detail

200
00:16:23,960 --> 00:16:25,000
clearly and precisely.

201
00:16:25,480 --> 00:16:27,272
Grand Secretary Zhao
advised Your Majesty

202
00:16:27,288 --> 00:16:29,000
to abandon the palace
and leave the city.

203
00:16:29,550 --> 00:16:31,440
How am I supposed to twist the truth

204
00:16:32,390 --> 00:16:33,550
to make this action

205
00:16:33,768 --> 00:16:35,256
sound justifiable in the edict,

206
00:16:35,840 --> 00:16:38,360
instead of demoralizing our forces

207
00:16:39,120 --> 00:16:40,790
and emboldening the rebels?

208
00:16:42,360 --> 00:16:43,750
Compiler Han is right.

209
00:16:44,056 --> 00:16:45,550
Grand Secretary Zhao is a learned man.

210
00:16:45,550 --> 00:16:46,600
Then please tell us,

211
00:16:46,720 --> 00:16:49,390
how should this edict be drafted?

212
00:16:55,390 --> 00:16:57,870
I once followed
the late Emperor in his uprising.

213
00:16:58,240 --> 00:17:01,320
The situation then was a hundred times
more perilous than today.

214
00:17:01,832 --> 00:17:03,960
Had the late Emperor
not adapted to the circumstances

215
00:17:04,088 --> 00:17:05,592
without fear of what others might say,

216
00:17:05,960 --> 00:17:08,550
we would not have this vast realm today.

217
00:17:09,400 --> 00:17:10,200
Your Majesty.

218
00:17:21,920 --> 00:17:23,680
Seize Zhao Jin and Dai Qing.

219
00:17:25,070 --> 00:17:26,350
Bind them here.

220
00:17:26,750 --> 00:17:30,270
- Your Majesty!
- Your Majesty!

221
00:17:31,270 --> 00:17:32,070
Your Majesty!

222
00:17:32,504 --> 00:17:34,510
I have only ever acted
in Your Majesty's interests.

223
00:17:34,510 --> 00:17:36,640
What crime
have I committed, Your Majesty?

224
00:17:38,030 --> 00:17:38,830
Your Majesty!

225
00:17:40,110 --> 00:17:40,550
Move!

226
00:17:47,350 --> 00:17:48,830
Zhao Jin and Dai Qing

227
00:17:49,096 --> 00:17:51,880
harbor treacherous intentions
and spread lies to mislead everyone.

228
00:17:52,110 --> 00:17:53,550
Confine them here for now.

229
00:17:53,752 --> 00:17:56,310
They will answer for their crimes
once the rebellion is quelled.

230
00:17:57,240 --> 00:17:59,790
When Father attacked Jinan,

231
00:18:00,350 --> 00:18:02,510
I was ordered to defend Beiping.

232
00:18:03,200 --> 00:18:05,880
With ten thousand troops,
I faced an army of 500,000.

233
00:18:05,960 --> 00:18:07,200
Yet the city held.

234
00:18:07,920 --> 00:18:09,590
I had no fear then.

235
00:18:09,960 --> 00:18:11,640
Why should a mere band of rebels

236
00:18:11,960 --> 00:18:13,590
make me lose my composure today?

237
00:18:14,400 --> 00:18:15,750
Pass down my command.

238
00:18:16,480 --> 00:18:19,110
Imperial Guard,
fall back to Qianqing Gate.

239
00:18:19,200 --> 00:18:20,640
Seal off Qianqing Palace.

240
00:18:21,200 --> 00:18:23,000
No one is to enter or leave.

241
00:18:23,550 --> 00:18:24,510
Anyone who disobeys

242
00:18:25,000 --> 00:18:25,880
will be killed!

243
00:18:27,030 --> 00:18:28,200
Your Majesty is wise!

244
00:18:29,070 --> 00:18:30,960
- Your Majesty is wise!
- Your Majesty is wise!

245
00:18:32,750 --> 00:18:33,960
Wang Cheng, Hai Tao.

246
00:18:34,590 --> 00:18:37,030
Distribute the weapons
to the guards and palace maids.

247
00:18:37,440 --> 00:18:37,960
Yes.

248
00:18:41,920 --> 00:18:42,920
Everyone,

249
00:18:43,790 --> 00:18:45,960
follow me to Qianqing Gate and fight.

250
00:18:46,350 --> 00:18:48,270
We'll  follow
Your Majesty to the death!

251
00:18:48,280 --> 00:18:51,230
- We'll follow Your Majesty to the death!
- We'll follow Your Majesty to the death!

252
00:18:51,240 --> 00:18:53,580
(Upholding Heaven's Mandate)

253
00:18:54,920 --> 00:18:55,310
Hurry!

254
00:18:55,336 --> 00:18:56,290
He should be just ahead.

255
00:19:14,270 --> 00:19:15,640
Search carefully.

256
00:19:16,550 --> 00:19:17,440
He's wounded.

257
00:19:17,512 --> 00:19:18,510
He can't have gone far.

258
00:19:20,200 --> 00:19:21,440
You two, search over there.

259
00:19:22,920 --> 00:19:24,270
The rest of you, follow me.

260
00:19:24,350 --> 00:19:25,160
Yes.

261
00:19:31,960 --> 00:19:33,030
Young Master!

262
00:19:35,240 --> 00:19:36,310
Take care!

263
00:20:16,440 --> 00:20:18,030
Lin Jinqi was struck by my arrow

264
00:20:18,750 --> 00:20:20,000
and caught in the blast.

265
00:20:20,000 --> 00:20:21,160
He suffered internal injuries.

266
00:20:21,640 --> 00:20:23,960
He's barely alive
after making it this far.

267
00:20:24,350 --> 00:20:26,070
He can't even hold his blade anymore.

268
00:20:27,550 --> 00:20:28,440
Men!

269
00:20:29,270 --> 00:20:32,550
Noble titles and high office
are within our grasp!

270
00:22:01,720 --> 00:22:03,000
Wei Bao!

271
00:22:06,030 --> 00:22:07,480
You wretched fool!

272
00:22:08,480 --> 00:22:10,440
I'll take your head

273
00:22:10,440 --> 00:22:12,550
and use it as a chamber pot!

274
00:22:20,960 --> 00:22:22,550
Where did this scoundrel come from?

275
00:22:22,720 --> 00:22:24,110
You dare challenge me

276
00:22:24,200 --> 00:22:25,680
with so few men?

277
00:22:25,880 --> 00:22:26,550
Men!

278
00:22:26,880 --> 00:22:28,350
Kill him first,

279
00:22:28,680 --> 00:22:29,790
and then capture Lin Jinqi!

280
00:22:29,790 --> 00:22:30,920
Wei, you wretch!

281
00:22:32,030 --> 00:22:34,400
You can't even catch me,

282
00:22:34,960 --> 00:22:37,310
yet you think you can catch Lin Jinqi?

283
00:22:41,160 --> 00:22:42,550
Lin Jinqi

284
00:22:43,790 --> 00:22:45,720
left long ago.

285
00:22:52,030 --> 00:22:54,350
Go to the underworld

286
00:22:54,720 --> 00:22:56,480
and dream on!

287
00:22:56,680 --> 00:22:58,000
Kill!

288
00:22:58,060 --> 00:23:00,900
♪I no longer blame the moon♪

289
00:23:00,900 --> 00:23:05,180
♪For withholding its light♪

290
00:23:05,860 --> 00:23:09,220
♪I only pray that those I've known♪

291
00:23:09,220 --> 00:23:12,900
♪Still live and thrive♪

292
00:23:13,260 --> 00:23:17,380
♪No longer let the world's
wind and snow fall♪

293
00:23:17,380 --> 00:23:20,420
♪And leave the grass
and trees covered in frost♪

294
00:23:20,740 --> 00:23:24,780
♪I only wish that
where the lights grow dim♪

295
00:23:24,780 --> 00:23:29,860
♪You and I will walk there together♪

296
00:24:03,720 --> 00:24:04,720
It's me.

297
00:24:08,020 --> 00:24:10,700
♪The golden sunset♪

298
00:24:10,700 --> 00:24:14,060
♪Sketches my thoughts♪

299
00:24:15,900 --> 00:24:18,420
♪All things fall silent, fearing♪

300
00:24:18,420 --> 00:24:21,780
♪To disturb this moment♪

301
00:24:22,460 --> 00:24:25,540
♪My restless heart♪

302
00:24:25,860 --> 00:24:29,220
♪Seeks a place to anchor♪

303
00:24:29,940 --> 00:24:35,260
♪I wonder if the past
has ever been heard♪

304
00:24:38,580 --> 00:24:41,500
♪Yesterday's brush and ink♪

305
00:24:41,500 --> 00:24:45,140
♪Lightly traced cause and effect♪

306
00:24:48,720 --> 00:24:49,400
Come on.

307
00:24:52,580 --> 00:24:56,100
♪Love and guilt intertwine♪

308
00:24:56,100 --> 00:24:59,780
♪If the image isn't real,
what does it matter?♪

309
00:25:00,420 --> 00:25:05,140
♪I still remember your name♪

310
00:25:07,580 --> 00:25:10,060
♪I no longer blame the moon♪

311
00:25:10,060 --> 00:25:14,820
♪For withholding its light♪

312
00:25:15,300 --> 00:25:18,540
♪I only pray that those I've known♪

313
00:25:18,540 --> 00:25:22,340
♪Still live and thrive♪

314
00:25:22,740 --> 00:25:27,180
♪No longer let the world's
wind and snow fall♪

315
00:25:27,180 --> 00:25:29,780
♪And leave the grass
and trees covered in frost♪

316
00:25:29,780 --> 00:25:34,140
♪I only wish that
where the lights grow dim♪

317
00:25:34,140 --> 00:25:38,700
♪You and I will walk there together♪

318
00:25:53,030 --> 00:25:53,510
Go.

319
00:25:54,270 --> 00:25:54,880
Go.

320
00:26:00,240 --> 00:26:01,680
Will Sun Yong be all right?

321
00:26:04,790 --> 00:26:06,030
He's a seasoned soldier.

322
00:26:06,960 --> 00:26:08,200
Once I'm gone,

323
00:26:09,200 --> 00:26:11,000
he won't fight them head-on.

324
00:26:19,000 --> 00:26:20,310
Why are you here?

325
00:26:25,590 --> 00:26:26,790
I don't want to be a widow.

326
00:26:28,200 --> 00:26:30,830
The Emperor arranged our marriage,
so I can't remarry.

327
00:26:49,480 --> 00:26:51,240
Where did you get this mule?

328
00:26:52,070 --> 00:26:53,510
I bought it from an old farmer.

329
00:26:54,270 --> 00:26:55,110
Around here,

330
00:26:55,256 --> 00:26:56,720
mules are more useful than horses.

331
00:26:59,830 --> 00:27:00,590
Brown sugar.

332
00:27:00,760 --> 00:27:01,920
You've lost too much blood.

333
00:27:01,992 --> 00:27:03,070
There's no hot water here,

334
00:27:03,510 --> 00:27:04,400
so make do with this.

335
00:27:06,240 --> 00:27:07,590
I just saw you

336
00:27:08,640 --> 00:27:09,920
feed some to the mule.

337
00:27:11,830 --> 00:27:12,790
Young Master Lin,

338
00:27:12,960 --> 00:27:14,240
it's freezing out here.

339
00:27:14,240 --> 00:27:16,580
If I don't feed it something good,
how will it keep going?

340
00:27:31,030 --> 00:27:31,680
Young Master.

341
00:27:35,000 --> 00:27:35,790
Young Master.

342
00:27:36,480 --> 00:27:37,310
Don't fall asleep.

343
00:27:37,680 --> 00:27:38,550
Talk to me.

344
00:27:40,240 --> 00:27:41,030
Young Master.

345
00:27:43,000 --> 00:27:44,000
Lin Jinqi.

346
00:27:44,200 --> 00:27:45,160
Lin Jinqi!

347
00:28:05,992 --> 00:28:07,960
Everyone in the Lin family
is counting on you.

348
00:28:09,440 --> 00:28:10,680
You have to stay alive.

349
00:28:12,110 --> 00:28:13,200
Stay alive.

350
00:28:13,510 --> 00:28:14,720
You have to stay alive!

351
00:28:19,750 --> 00:28:21,590
Lin Jinqi, don't fall asleep.

352
00:28:26,590 --> 00:28:27,070
Go.

353
00:28:45,480 --> 00:28:46,160
Help!

354
00:28:46,160 --> 00:28:47,440
Stop! Don't run!

355
00:28:50,240 --> 00:28:51,550
Go. Check over there.

356
00:28:53,352 --> 00:28:54,650
There are still people upstairs.

357
00:28:56,960 --> 00:28:57,440
Go.

358
00:29:30,110 --> 00:29:30,880
Jinlan.

359
00:29:31,750 --> 00:29:33,480
Why don't we have Second Butler Yang

360
00:29:33,830 --> 00:29:35,720
bar the main gate from outside?

361
00:29:36,030 --> 00:29:37,240
If the rebels come,

362
00:29:37,680 --> 00:29:38,920
at least it'll slow them down.

363
00:29:39,830 --> 00:29:41,310
A wooden door won't stop the rebels.

364
00:29:41,528 --> 00:29:43,000
They'll kick it open in one blow.

365
00:29:44,310 --> 00:29:45,240
Why don't we

366
00:29:45,790 --> 00:29:48,000
barricade the door
with tables and chairs?

367
00:29:50,280 --> 00:29:51,672
This is the Empty Fort Strategy.

368
00:29:54,480 --> 00:29:55,920
Chancellor Zhuge used this strategy

369
00:29:56,480 --> 00:29:58,480
to frighten off Sima Yi's vast army.

370
00:29:58,640 --> 00:30:00,000
As long as we all stay well hidden,

371
00:30:00,024 --> 00:30:01,310
we should have no trouble fooling

372
00:30:01,680 --> 00:30:02,830
a few soldiers and bandits.

373
00:30:03,880 --> 00:30:05,750
The neighborhood
where the troupe is based

374
00:30:06,640 --> 00:30:08,590
is home to people
with no money or influence.

375
00:30:08,920 --> 00:30:10,310
There's nothing worth taking here.

376
00:30:11,128 --> 00:30:13,440
A large group of soldiers
and bandits is unlikely to come.

377
00:30:14,270 --> 00:30:16,510
Even if a few stragglers

378
00:30:16,920 --> 00:30:18,750
come looking for valuables,

379
00:30:19,510 --> 00:30:21,030
they'll surely be in a hurry.

380
00:30:21,830 --> 00:30:23,750
If they see the theater doors wide open,

381
00:30:24,350 --> 00:30:25,750
they'll assume everyone has fled.

382
00:30:27,350 --> 00:30:28,590
If the doors are locked,

383
00:30:29,160 --> 00:30:31,240
they'll suspect someone is inside

384
00:30:31,830 --> 00:30:33,160
and break in.

385
00:30:35,030 --> 00:30:35,920
Xiuwan,

386
00:30:36,536 --> 00:30:38,240
those two years of study weren't wasted.

387
00:30:41,550 --> 00:30:42,270
Anyone in there?

388
00:30:43,000 --> 00:30:43,640
Get out here!

389
00:30:45,160 --> 00:30:45,880
Stop hiding!

390
00:30:50,110 --> 00:30:51,480
Come out now!

391
00:30:51,544 --> 00:30:53,790
If we have to find you
ourselves, you'll regret it!

392
00:30:53,920 --> 00:30:55,070
Let me find you.

393
00:30:55,110 --> 00:30:56,000
Come out now!

394
00:31:00,240 --> 00:31:01,640
It's just a rundown theater.

395
00:31:01,640 --> 00:31:02,350
Let's go.

396
00:31:02,360 --> 00:31:03,400
Let's look somewhere else.

397
00:31:03,400 --> 00:31:04,030
Go.

398
00:31:07,110 --> 00:31:08,110
Give me my money back!

399
00:31:16,880 --> 00:31:18,200
Everyone inside, come out!

400
00:31:18,350 --> 00:31:19,160
We heard you!

401
00:31:19,550 --> 00:31:20,270
Get out here now!

402
00:31:20,312 --> 00:31:22,160
I didn't notice
the young lady had woken up.

403
00:31:22,160 --> 00:31:22,960
It's my fault.

404
00:31:28,830 --> 00:31:29,480
Come out!

405
00:31:30,440 --> 00:31:31,480
Yingzhi is still little.

406
00:31:32,720 --> 00:31:34,200
Xiulai, don't cover her like that.

407
00:31:34,200 --> 00:31:35,550
Get out here! Do you hear me?

408
00:31:36,480 --> 00:31:38,160
Be careful not to hurt Yingzhi.

409
00:31:38,160 --> 00:31:39,030
If we find you,

410
00:31:39,400 --> 00:31:40,830
we'll tear you to pieces!

411
00:31:44,590 --> 00:31:46,270
If you don't come out, we're coming in!

412
00:31:46,536 --> 00:31:48,000
You'd better not let us catch you!

413
00:31:48,590 --> 00:31:49,510
Get out here!

414
00:31:52,070 --> 00:31:53,750
We already heard something inside.

415
00:31:53,960 --> 00:31:55,240
Someone's definitely in there.

416
00:31:55,590 --> 00:31:56,480
I'll go out.

417
00:31:56,790 --> 00:31:59,240
This is my fault. I'll lure them away.

418
00:31:59,240 --> 00:32:01,110
No, Xiulai.

419
00:32:01,480 --> 00:32:02,750
Stay hidden here.

420
00:32:03,400 --> 00:32:04,480
Don't make a sound.

421
00:32:04,640 --> 00:32:05,880
I'm losing my patience!

422
00:32:06,790 --> 00:32:08,110
Yingzhi and I will go out.

423
00:32:33,720 --> 00:32:34,920
Get out here! Do you hear me?

424
00:32:35,350 --> 00:32:37,030
Our patience is running out!

425
00:32:37,830 --> 00:32:38,720
We're coming in!

426
00:33:04,790 --> 00:33:05,510
Yingzhi.

427
00:33:06,920 --> 00:33:08,750
From now on, let's play a game.

428
00:33:10,000 --> 00:33:11,830
Pretend you're mute and can't speak.

429
00:33:12,350 --> 00:33:13,200
I'm your father.

430
00:33:17,440 --> 00:33:19,200
I'll go with Second Young Master.

431
00:33:20,776 --> 00:33:22,152
Since we can't beat them anyway,

432
00:33:22,160 --> 00:33:23,850
more people would
only make things worse.

433
00:33:24,580 --> 00:33:27,380
(Yang Fu, Butler of the Lin Residence
in the Capital)

434
00:34:11,150 --> 00:34:12,510
The snow will be deep tomorrow.

435
00:34:12,670 --> 00:34:14,400
I'll ask Xiulai and Xiuwan to join us,

436
00:34:15,960 --> 00:34:17,592
and we'll build a snowman together.

437
00:34:19,230 --> 00:34:19,880
Okay.

438
00:34:36,510 --> 00:34:38,670
Xiulai, don't worry.

439
00:34:40,550 --> 00:34:43,150
Jinlan will bring Yingzhi back safely.

440
00:34:48,710 --> 00:34:49,590
Hurry up and come out!

441
00:34:50,150 --> 00:34:51,670
I can hear a child crying!

442
00:34:52,280 --> 00:34:54,440
Sir...

443
00:34:55,880 --> 00:34:57,320
I...

444
00:34:59,920 --> 00:35:00,710
What's going on?

445
00:35:01,150 --> 00:35:02,280
Where is everyone?

446
00:35:07,190 --> 00:35:07,880
Lord Lin...

447
00:35:08,440 --> 00:35:09,920
Lord Lin asked the troupe leader

448
00:35:10,190 --> 00:35:11,670
to perform for Madam Lin's birthday.

449
00:35:12,190 --> 00:35:13,480
Before dawn this morning,

450
00:35:14,070 --> 00:35:16,190
the troupe leader
took the troupe out of the city.

451
00:35:17,670 --> 00:35:18,320
The stagehands

452
00:35:19,110 --> 00:35:21,670
went along to carry
the costumes and dressing tables.

453
00:35:22,376 --> 00:35:24,000
Only one old stagehand stayed behind.

454
00:35:24,248 --> 00:35:26,488
When he heard there was trouble
in the city, he ran away.

455
00:35:28,480 --> 00:35:30,400
That matches
what the woman earlier said.

456
00:35:30,800 --> 00:35:32,000
Then why didn't you run?

457
00:35:36,230 --> 00:35:36,840
I...

458
00:35:37,360 --> 00:35:38,510
I have tuberculosis.

459
00:35:39,110 --> 00:35:39,960
I can't run.

460
00:35:45,440 --> 00:35:46,710
And I have a mute daughter.

461
00:35:49,190 --> 00:35:50,760
We'll just live for as long as we can.

462
00:35:52,616 --> 00:35:53,440
What rotten luck.

463
00:36:07,070 --> 00:36:08,590
The little girl does

464
00:36:09,000 --> 00:36:10,280
look sickly.

465
00:36:11,550 --> 00:36:12,000
Let's go.

466
00:37:19,670 --> 00:37:20,280
Yingzhi.

467
00:37:21,960 --> 00:37:23,480
This is our little secret.

468
00:37:24,440 --> 00:37:25,590
Don't tell anyone.

469
00:37:33,800 --> 00:37:34,800
The game is over.

470
00:37:35,110 --> 00:37:36,000
You can talk now.

471
00:37:38,070 --> 00:37:39,000
Why?

472
00:37:43,670 --> 00:37:44,880
Because I know

473
00:37:45,670 --> 00:37:47,110
what heartache feels like.

474
00:37:49,710 --> 00:37:51,590
I don't want your Aunt Xiuwan,
your mother,

475
00:37:52,280 --> 00:37:53,880
or your Aunt Suhua to be heartbroken.

476
00:38:02,800 --> 00:38:03,710
Let's go home.

477
00:38:16,110 --> 00:38:17,150
The soldiers are gone?

478
00:38:18,440 --> 00:38:18,960
They're gone.

479
00:38:24,190 --> 00:38:24,630
Come on.

480
00:38:27,580 --> 00:38:31,740
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

481
00:38:34,580 --> 00:38:38,620
♪No page could hold
the longing words can never show♪

482
00:38:40,820 --> 00:38:44,300
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

483
00:38:46,550 --> 00:38:48,400
Thank goodness Jinlan was here.

484
00:38:50,550 --> 00:38:51,960
Otherwise, we would all have...

485
00:38:54,940 --> 00:38:58,820
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

486
00:38:58,820 --> 00:39:01,940
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

487
00:39:01,940 --> 00:39:05,940
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

488
00:39:05,940 --> 00:39:08,700
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

489
00:39:08,700 --> 00:39:12,980
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

490
00:39:12,980 --> 00:39:16,100
♪And silver moonlight
to guide me through the night♪

491
00:39:16,100 --> 00:39:20,020
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

492
00:39:20,020 --> 00:39:24,300
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

493
00:40:04,070 --> 00:40:04,880
Cold.

494
00:40:06,872 --> 00:40:08,030
I didn't dare light a fire.

495
00:40:08,030 --> 00:40:09,540
The smoke might draw the soldiers here.

496
00:40:09,550 --> 00:40:11,000
You'll have to make do, Young Master.

497
00:40:11,760 --> 00:40:13,110
Here, drink some water.

498
00:40:27,280 --> 00:40:27,840
Young Master.

499
00:40:38,800 --> 00:40:39,960
Where are we?

500
00:40:40,392 --> 00:40:43,000
The old man said there's a reed marsh
at the foot of the mountain.

501
00:40:43,320 --> 00:40:45,480
They raise ducks there in the summer.

502
00:40:45,670 --> 00:40:46,710
To keep watch over them,

503
00:40:47,096 --> 00:40:48,590
they built a simple thatched shelter.

504
00:41:19,280 --> 00:41:20,230
Now,

505
00:41:20,744 --> 00:41:22,710
I no longer
have the strength to protect you.

506
00:41:24,510 --> 00:41:25,800
Use this to defend yourself.

507
00:41:30,000 --> 00:41:30,710
This is...

508
00:41:30,960 --> 00:41:31,960
This is a firearm.

509
00:41:32,280 --> 00:41:33,320
Like a bow,

510
00:41:33,480 --> 00:41:35,000
it can kill enemies from a distance.

511
00:41:35,112 --> 00:41:37,760
But you have to load gunpowder
and a projectile after every shot.

512
00:41:43,710 --> 00:41:44,840
Load the gunpowder.

513
00:41:51,000 --> 00:41:52,360
Load the projectile.

514
00:42:04,630 --> 00:42:06,150
Open the flash pan cover.

515
00:42:14,670 --> 00:42:16,030
Light the fuse.

516
00:42:18,320 --> 00:42:19,550
Then aim.

517
00:43:04,820 --> 00:43:07,380
=Against the Current=
(Next Episode's Preview)

518
00:43:14,000 --> 00:43:16,320
You beast! I'll kill you!

519
00:43:24,480 --> 00:43:25,030
Come on!

520
00:43:25,150 --> 00:43:26,230
I'll kill you!

521
00:43:27,704 --> 00:43:28,760
Is that all you've got?

522
00:43:28,880 --> 00:43:29,590
I'm fine.

523
00:43:29,670 --> 00:43:30,960
She's just a woman.

524
00:43:46,661 --> 00:43:50,781
♪Spring slips from the
branches once more♪

525
00:43:53,621 --> 00:43:58,141
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

526
00:43:59,421 --> 00:44:03,341
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

527
00:44:04,021 --> 00:44:06,781
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

528
00:44:07,501 --> 00:44:09,821
♪Though all the world may fade♪

529
00:44:09,821 --> 00:44:12,901
♪Time rolls on as
countless lives rush by♪

530
00:44:14,421 --> 00:44:18,661
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

531
00:44:21,581 --> 00:44:25,741
♪No page could hold the
longing words can never show♪

532
00:44:27,541 --> 00:44:31,101
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

533
00:44:31,101 --> 00:44:34,661
♪Fades into the past
as new wounds rise♪

534
00:44:35,461 --> 00:44:41,141
♪While whispers of perfume
linger beneath the eaves♪

535
00:44:41,501 --> 00:44:45,821
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

536
00:44:46,181 --> 00:44:49,141
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

537
00:44:49,141 --> 00:44:52,901
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

538
00:44:52,901 --> 00:44:55,781
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

539
00:44:55,781 --> 00:44:59,861
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

540
00:44:59,861 --> 00:45:03,221
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

541
00:45:03,221 --> 00:45:06,981
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

542
00:45:06,981 --> 00:45:10,981
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

543
